# The workspace root's own `/target/` and `__pycache__/`/`*.py[cod]` entries
# already cover cargo's build output and every compiled Python cache in this
# crate; nothing here duplicates those. What is left is local Python tooling
# state that only ever appears under this crate, from a manual `maturin
# develop` or an editable install: `maturin develop`'s own virtualenv and
# dependency lock, and the compiled extension it drops directly into the
# source tree next to the hand-written `__init__.py`/`__init__.pyi`.
*.egg-info/
.venv/
uv.lock
python/registry_evidence_client/*.so
